# Signed scope: Willow Yoga Studio website

Fixed price: $4,800. Signed 1 September 2026. Launch: 6 October 2026.

## Included

- S1. Five pages: Home, Classes, Teachers, Pricing, Contact.
- S2. A class schedule on the Classes page, read from a Google Sheet that the studio edits.
- S3. A contact form that emails the studio.
- S4. A layout that works on phones and tablets.
- S5. Basic SEO: page titles, meta descriptions and a sitemap.
- S6. Two rounds of design changes on the agreed mockups.
- S7. Bug fixes for 30 days after launch (until 5 November 2026).

## Not included

Online payments, member logins, a blog, other languages, writing page text,
photography, and any work after the 30-day bug-fix window.


